1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:03,105
(Sheldon:)No wonder you didn't get
that toothpaste commercial.

2
00:00:07,278 --> 00:00:09,338
- Hey.
- Hey.

3
00:00:09,848 --> 00:00:13,878
(Raj:)I want to apologize for Amy last night.
She was completely out of line.

4
00:00:20,024 --> 00:00:23,484
(Raj:)Are you not speaking to me
or did the screen freeze again?

5
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:25,795
(Lucy:)Amy wasn't the problem.

6
00:00:26,498 --> 00:00:29,128
(Raj:)Okay, I know, it was me.

7
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,390
(Raj:)I pushed too hard. I'm sorry.

8
00:00:31,569 --> 00:00:32,869
(Leonard:)Thank you.

9
00:00:34,005 --> 00:00:37,775
You know, I've been thinking that maybe
meeting somebody one-on-one...

10
00:00:37,942 --> 00:00:39,132
(Raj:)...is too intense...

11
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:42,250
(Raj:)...so Friday night,
my friends are having a party.

12
00:00:42,413 --> 00:00:44,713
- A party?
- A little one.

13
00:00:44,883 --> 00:00:49,213
(Raj:)It's a farewell for Leonard,
so all the attention will be on him.

14
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:53,327
(Raj:)If you wear something brown and sit on the
couch, they won't even know you're there.

15
00:00:55,527 --> 00:00:57,557
- I'm not sure.
- Please.

16
00:00:57,729 --> 00:01:00,019
(Scene:)- Raj.
- Come on, don't make me beg.

